OL,3,GNEWSAThe ex-anarchist vicar bringing   
OL,4,Apunk to the church                     
OL,6,F"My inner punk rocker is still very    
OL,7,Fmuch alive and kicking underneath the  
OL,8,Fdog collar and glasses," he said.      
